      "en": {
        "name": "Crye Precision CPC plate carrier (Goons Edition Version II)",
        "shortName": "CPC GE II",
        "description": "The CAGE PLATE CARRIER (CPC) offers unrivaled comfort and load support in a low profile plate carrier configuration. The system supports a range of different pouches. In this case, the configuration is made by the leader of the Goons squad - Knight - for conducting assault operations with increased mobility."
