        "shortName": "CPC EG II",
        "description": "The CAGE PLATE CARRIER (CPC) offers unmatched comfort and load-bearing support in a low-profile plate carrier configuration. The system is compatible with a variety of different pouches. In this case, the configuration was designed by the Goons squad leader—Knight—to enable assault operations with greater mobility."
      },
      "ru": {
